CHAPTER.VERS:
And of the Gadites there separated themselves to David in the strong hold in the wilderness men of might,  men of war  for the battle, that could handle shield and buckler, whose faces  the faces of lions, and  as swift as the roes upon the mountains; 

          of war: Heb. of the host



          as swift…: Heb. as the roes upon the mountains to make haste
